Package: kubeos-metrics-server
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: KubeOS metrics API (metrics-server as a host service)
 The metrics API that makes "kubectl top" work, run as a systemd unit instead of the
 usual Deployment, so a fresh node answers "kubectl top nodes" while "kubectl get pods
 -A" is still empty - the KubeOS rule that the base system runs no Pods.
 .
 Upstream publishes no Debian package and a node has no registry after installation,
 so the official release binary is fetched at build time, verified against a pinned
 SHA256, and installed as /usr/bin/metrics-server.
